{
 "x:bang_tam": "Băng Tâm Các, the Ice sect of the frozen north. Uniform: flowing layered robes of white silk with ice-blue edged collars, wide sleeves, a frost-silk sash, a white jade snowflake badge at the breast. Servants: plain white cotton-silk, no badge. Outer disciples: white robes, a thin pale-blue collar edge, a plain white sash. Inner disciples: add a pale-blue sash and silver snowflake embroidery at the cuffs. True disciples: a translucent frost-gauze over-robe and a white jade hairpin. Stewards: white robes with a blue collar and a white jade abacus or seal at the sash. Elders: a pale blue gauze over-robe that drifts like mist, silver snowflakes and frost ferns embroidered at hem and cuffs, a frost-silk sash with a white jade pendant. Head: all white, the finest frost silk, the jade vessel at her breast, nothing else of colour.",
 "x:phat_y": "Phất Y Cốc, the valley of hired swords. Uniform: long robes of grey silk with one long left sleeve that falls past the hand, charcoal-edged collars, a narrow charcoal sash with a small silver sword-token badge. Outer disciples: short sleeves until their first contract, plain grey. Inner disciples: the long left sleeve and the sword-token. Elders: a silver-grey gauze over-robe, the long sleeve embroidered with a faint wind pattern, a silver crown. Head: the founder's grey robe with its long sleeve over the finest grey silk.",
 "x:phuong_minh": "Phượng Minh Cung, the Fire court of the phoenix. Uniform: layered robes of vermilion and gold silk, collars embroidered with phoenix feathers in gold thread, wide trailing sleeves, a gold sash with a red jade badge shaped like a flame. Servants: plain rust-red cotton-silk. Outer disciples: orange-red robes with a narrow gold collar edge. Inner disciples: vermilion robes, gold flames embroidered on the collar, a red silk hair ribbon. True disciples: a dawn-orange gauze over-robe and a gold hairpin. Elders: deep crimson and gold brocade, phoenix feathers embroidered across the shoulders, a gold crown. Head: splendid vermilion, gold and dawn-orange silk, phoenix hairpins and a flame-shaped crown.",
 "x:thien_xu": "Thiên Xu Tông, the Pivot of the central plateau. Uniform: stately robes of bronze and earth-gold silk, collars embroidered with the seven Dipper stars in gold, a broad sash with a yellow jade badge. Outer disciples: plain bronze-brown robes, one gold star at the collar. Inner disciples: earth-gold robes, the seven stars at the collar. Stewards: a dark brown over-robe with a jade seal at the sash. Elders: a black silk outer robe with a high collar over bronze and gold, mountain ridges embroidered at the hem, a bronze crown. Head and first elder: black and gold brocade, a heavy gold crown and a great yellow jade seal.",
 "x:tung_dao": "Tùng Đào Cung, the palace of the pine sea. Uniform: flowing robes of pale bark-cream silk with pine-green collars embroidered with pine needles, a hairpin shaped like a pine twig. Servants: plain bark-cream cotton, a wooden pine-twig pin. Outer disciples: bark-cream silk, a thin green cord sash, a wooden pine-twig hairpin. Inner disciples: add a needle-green silk sash and a small green jade pine-cone pendant. Elders: a grey-green gauze over-robe embroidered with wind-curls, a jade pine-twig hairpin. Head: the undyed listening robe of fine bark-cream silk under grey-green gauze, a bronze censer at the sash.",
 "x:thinh_vu": "Thính Vũ Lâu, the Tower Where One Listens to the Rain, a dark Thunder house. Uniform: robes of black and storm-violet silk under a black oiled-silk over-robe that falls like rain, collars embroidered with silver lightning, a small bronze bell at the sash. Outer disciples: plain black robes, one silver lightning stroke at the collar. Inner disciples: violet-edged collars and a bronze bell. Elders: silver lightning and raindrops embroidered down the sleeves, dark silver hairpins, a bronze seal. Head: storm-violet brocade under black gauze, silver lightning across the shoulders, a silver crown.",
 "x:muc_van": "Mục Vân Trang, the cloud-herder horse manor of the western plain. Uniform: riding robes of grass-green and cloud-white silk, collars embroidered with running horses, a sash with a white jade horse badge. Outer disciples: plain grass-green riding robes. Inner disciples: cloud-white collars and the jade horse. Elders: a sky-blue gauze over-robe embroidered with clouds, a silver ring in the hair. Head: the finest green and white silk under sky-blue gauze, running horses in silver across the shoulders, a silver crown.",
 "x:da_quang": "Dạ Quang Môn, the night-glow riders of the desert edge. Uniform: robes of night-blue and dune-gold silk, a flowing sand-coloured gauze over-robe, collars embroidered with crescent moons in pale gold, a dark silk headwrap. Outer disciples: plain night-blue robes, one crescent at the collar. Inner disciples: the gauze over-robe and gold crescents. Elders: stars and moons in gold across the shoulders, a gold headwrap pin. Head: the richest night-blue and gold, a glowing jade cup at the sash, a gold-pinned headwrap.",
 "x:thu_phan": "Thu Phần Các, the ma đạo grave-keepers among the old graves. Uniform: mourning robes of undyed white and ash-grey silk, collars embroidered with withered lotus in dull silver, a bone hairpin. Outer disciples: plain ash-grey robes. Inner disciples: white robes with silver lotus at the collar. Elders: a translucent black gauze over-robe that moves like smoke. Head: white and ash-grey silk under black gauze, withered lotus and incense curls in silver, a dark resentment-jade seal at the sash.",
 "x:coc_vu": "Cốc Vũ Quán, the rain-calling rice abbey. Uniform: soft robes of rain-grey and rice-green silk, collars embroidered with falling rain and rice ears, a light rice-straw hat on a silk cord. Outer disciples: plain rain-grey robes. Inner disciples: rice-green collars and a green jade drop at the sash. Rite masters and elders: a pale grey gauze over-robe beaded as if with dew, rain embroidered down the sleeves. Head: the abbess's robe of the finest rain-grey silk, a gourd of seed rice and a rain-calling banner."
}